t also increases. Everything you get during the expeditions is yours and can be used to build your Village. You decide on the pace of its development. You are its leader.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.poster.avif?t=1769669812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.webm?t=1769669812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/9aee9b91158d3fa613176c8f26760fc5.mp4?t=1769669812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/5291a9b702f943933996dde50c16e9ff.avif?t=1769669812\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>In Daomei Village, everyone has committed a crime of some sort. When interacting with the townspeople, you will receive tasks that will help you gain their trust. Moreover, you will learn the reason behind their crime.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/extras/ce76627d5726c131c464614ee71d3f96.avif?t=1769669812\" width=616 height=162 /></span><br>Daomei Village is an absolutely unique and magical place. You will come across the traces of previous dynasties, learn about the unique Chinese folklore and demonology. You will celebrate feasts accordingQ to the Chinese calendar, as well as the birthdays of the residents. You cannot miss it!","developers":["Gameparic"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.