a51180df435f54e52ba41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769669812","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825030/ss_b1862a58b2f73dbffcda51180df435f54e52ba41.600x338.jpg?t=1769669812"}],"short_description":"You have been banished to Daomei Village for your offense. In order to return to the Emperor's favor, you must make an effort. Repair, build, cultivate fields and fight various adversities. Meet new friends and learn their stories. Do whatever it takes not to be banished forever!","steam_appid":1825030,"support_info":{"email":"hello@gameparic.com","url":"https://gameparic.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}